sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI
    participant Store as Zustand Store
    participant Bridge as PyWebView Bridge
    participant API as BacktestAPI
    participant Engine as BacktestEngine
    participant Strategy as Strategy Class
    participant Repo as Repository Layer
    participant DB as SQLite

    UI->>Store: dispatch: runBacktest(params)
    activate Store
    Store->>Store: setIsRunning(true)
    Store->>Bridge: window.pywebview.api.run_backtest(params)
    
    Bridge->>API: BacktestAPI.run_backtest(params)
    activate API
    
    Note over API: Load merged strategy config
    API->>API: load_strategy_config()
    
    Note over API: Create pending run record
    API->>Repo: runs_repo.create_pending_run()
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO runs (status='pending')
    DB-->>Repo: run_id
    Repo-->>API: run_id
    
    Note over API: Initialize engine
    API->>Engine: BacktestEngine(data_path, strategy, config)
    activate Engine
    
    API->>Engine: engine.run()
    Engine->>Strategy: strategy.process_candle(row)
    
    loop For each candle in data
        Strategy->>Strategy: Check entry/exit conditions
        Strategy-->>Engine: signal or None
        Engine->>Engine: Execute trade if signal
    end
    
    Engine-->>API: BacktestResult
    deactivate Engine
    
    Note over API: Persist results to DB
    API->>Repo: runs_repo.update_run(run_id, 'completed')
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE runs SET status='completed'
    
    API->>Repo: runs_repo.save_results(run_id, metrics)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO run_results
    
    API->>Repo: trades_repo.save_trades(run_id, trades)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO trades (batch)
    
    API->>Repo: timeseries_repo.save_timeseries(run_id, equity)
    Note over Repo: Compress with zlib
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO run_timeseries (BLOB)
    
    API-->>Bridge: {run_id, metrics, equity_preview}
    deactivate API
    
    Bridge-->>Store: Promise resolves
    Store->>Store: setResults(response)
    Store->>Store: setIsRunning(false)
    Store-->>UI: Re-render with results
    deactivate Store
    
    Note over UI: Display metrics cards, charts
